                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mi b
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f^*(b)
                itself.
            %li
              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/well-ordering+theorem"} well-ordering theorem
                (that any set can be
                = succeed ")," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/well-order"} well-ordered
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zorn%27s+lemma"}> Zorn's lemma
                ,
            %li
              %p
                That (
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
