            %li#EsoFFFunctorEquivalence
              %p
                That every
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fully+faithful+functor"} fully faithful
                and
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/essentially+surjective+functor"} essentially surjective
                functor between
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/small+categories"} small
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+categories"} strict categories
                is a strong
                = succeed "." do
